          "connect_nulls": false,
          "interpretation": "The published index rose to 37.4 in 2018, declined to 34.8 in 2022, and increased to 35.9 in 2023. No values after 2023 are supplied by the inspected table."
        },
        "source_ids": ["s1", "s2"]
      }
    ],
    "datasets": [
